摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"ADHD 友好输出风格（移植自 i-have-adhd）","id":"gh:1335106377","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-i-have-adhd","slug":"GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-i-have-adhd","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"ADHD 友好输出风格（移植自 i-have-adhd）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-i-have-adhd"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **一句话：打一句 `/i-have-adhd`，让 agent 从此先给行动、多步编号、砍掉寒暄 —— 输出为 ADHD 读者而塑造，不需要任何诊断。**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"移植自 `i-have-adhd`（MIT，20k+★），\n上游的 `SKILL.md` 逐字保留、未翻译，只适配 DeepSeek Harness\n的插件接口：dsh 没有 skill 服务，所以 "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"`/i-have-adhd` 注册成一条命令，把 SKILL.md 正文按字节注入当前会话。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ 功能"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- 🧠 **先给行动** —— 第一行就是能做的事：命令、路径、代码片段在前，散文靠后\n- 🔢 **多步任务编号** —— 每步一个动作、步数最少，没有“然后然后”\n- 🎯 **结尾一个具体下一步**"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" —— 还开着的事，给一件两分钟内能做完的\n- ✂️ **抑制离题** —— 先收尾当前问题，第二件事单独再问\n- 🔁 **每轮重述状态** —— “第 3/5 步完成”，不让读者自己记住\n- ⏱ *"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"*具体时间估计** —— 分钟数，不是“一会儿”\n- ✅ **让完成可见** —— 直接展示现在能跑的东西，不把成果埋进总结\n- 🤐 **完整 10 条规则** —— 全文见 `skills/i-ha"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ve-adhd/SKILL.md`（逐字保留）"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 📸 效果"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Before"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> Great question! Let me think about this. Your auth flow has a few moving pieces: the middleware, t"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"he token verification, and the cookie handling. Looking at `src/auth.ts`, the `verifyToken` function"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" (around lines 42-58) seems to be using an older `jsonwebtoken` API. One approach would be to update"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" the package and rewrite that function. After making the change, you'd want to run the auth tests to"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" confirm nothing breaks. By the way, you might also want to look at your dependency versions overall"},{"id":"p10s6","text":". Hope this helps! Let me know if you want to dig deeper."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## After"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> Run `npm install jsonwebtoken@latest`, then edit `src/auth.ts:42`.\n>\n> 1. Open `src/auth.ts`\n> 2. "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"Replace `verifyToken` (lines 42–58) with the snippet below\n> 3. Run `npm test -- auth.spec.ts`\n>\n> N"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ext: paste the first failing line if any test fails."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 📦 安装"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"本包零构建、零运行时依赖（仅 peer `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm`，由 profile 提供）。若 pnpm 拦下依赖\n安装，在 profile 的 `pnpm-workspace."},{"id":"p15s2","text":"yaml` 里把本包加进 `allowBuilds`。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"从本地目录安装："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 🚀 用法"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"规则对会话内后续每一轮生效，话题切换也不会失效；不确定时，仍然生效。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"移植说明（对上游 ayghri/i-have-adhd，commit 2ed0640）"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"逐字保留（`cmp` 验证一致，42 个文件）：`skills/i-have-adhd/SKILL.md` 与 `agents/*`、\n`extensions/i-have-adhd.ts`、`hoo"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ks/*`、`evals/*`、`scripts/*`、`tests/*`、\n各平台 manifest（`.claude-plugin/` `.codex-plugin/` `.cursor/` `."},{"id":"p22s3","text":"agents/` gemini/kimi/qwen/plugin.json）、\n`GEMINI.md`、`INSTALL.md`、`.github/*`（4 个 workflow + 5 种语言的 R"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"mi/qwen/plugin.json）、\n`GEMINI.md`、`INSTALL.md`、`.github/*`（4 个 workflow + 5 种语言的 README/INSTALL 翻译）。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**这一点你可以自己验，不必信我们** —— THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\n钉住了上游 commit 与每个逐字文件的 SHA-256，附可直接复制的比对命令。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"有限适配（dsh 与上游分发机制不同，逐条见 NOTICES）：\n- `package.json`：改名 `dsh-i-have-adhd`（本票要求）、新增 `dsh.bundle.patch` 与"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" `main`/`files`/`scripts.test`；上游 `pi` 键原样保留\n- 新增 `src/index.js` + `cordis.patch.yml`：dsh 没有 skill 服"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"务，`/i-have-adhd` 以命令形式注册，把 SKILL.md 正文按字节注入会话\n- 新增 `test/*.test.js`：转接层测试（node:test）\n- `README.md` 换"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"成移植品门面（中文优先双语）；`LICENSE` 加移植行；`.gitignore` 并入上游条目"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**已知限制：** dsh 侧没有与上游 always-on hook（`~/.claude/.i-have-adhd-always`）等价的\nSessionStart 机制，本移植只提供 `/i-h"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ave-adhd` 按需开启；上游 `scripts/check_pi_extension.py`\n与 `pi-load-check.yml` 是 pi 语境的校验，包名按本票改为 `dsh-i-ha"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ve-adhd` 后无法运行，按「全搬」规则保留未改。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🛠 开发"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT。上游 `i-have-adhd`\n`Copyright (c) 2026 Ayoub Ghriss`，本移植 `Copyright (c) 2026 GongYuanCaiJi`。见 LICE"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"上游 `i-have-adhd`\n`Copyright (c) 2026 Ayoub Ghriss`，本移植 `Copyright (c) 2026 GongYuanCaiJi`。见 LICENSE。"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"感谢 ayghri/i-have-adhd 的原作者 ——\n如果这个插件对你有用，**也请去给上游仓库点个 star**。"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"# English"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> **One line: type `/i-have-adhd` and the agent shapes every response for an ADHD reader — action fi"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"rst, numbered steps, no preamble. No diagnosis needed.**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"A port of `i-have-adhd` (MIT, 20k+★) to\nDeepSeek Harness. The upstream `SKILL.md` is\nkept byte-ident"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ical and untranslated; DeepSeek Harness has no skill service, so `/i-have-adhd`\nis registered as a c"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"ommand that injects the skill body verbatim into the current session."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- 🧠 **Lead with the action** — the first line is something you can do: command, path, or snippet fir"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"st, prose after\n- 🔢 **Number multi-step work** — one bounded action per step, the fewest steps that "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"still work\n- 🎯 **End with one concrete next step** — one thing doable in under two minutes\n- ✂️ **Su"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"ppress tangents** — finish the first issue, offer the second separately\n- 🔁 **Restate state every tu"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"rn** — “step 3 of 5 done”, never make the reader hold it\n- ⏱ **Specific time estimates** — minutes, "},{"id":"p35s6","text":"not “a bit”\n- ✅ **Make wins visible** — show what now works, don't bury it in a recap\n- 🤐 **Full 10-"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"rule text** — see `skills/i-have-adhd/SKILL.md` (verbatim)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## 📸 Before / After"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Before"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"> Great question! Let me think about this. Your auth flow has a few moving pieces: the middleware, t"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"he token verification, and the cookie handling. Looking at `src/auth.ts`, the `verifyToken` function"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" (around lines 42-58) seems to be using an older `jsonwebtoken` API. One approach would be to update"},{"id":"p38s4","text":" the package and rewrite that function. After making the change, you'd want to run the auth tests to"},{"id":"p38s5","text":" confirm nothing breaks. By the way, you might also want to look at your dependency versions overall"},{"id":"p38s6","text":". Hope this helps! Let me know if you want to dig deeper."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## After"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"> Run `npm install jsonwebtoken@latest`, then edit `src/auth.ts:42`.\n>\n> 1. Open `src/auth.ts`\n> 2. "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"Replace `verifyToken` (lines 42–58) with the snippet below\n> 3. Run `npm test -- auth.spec.ts`\n>\n> N"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ext: paste the first failing line if any test fails."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
